## Customize flags given to the VM: https://www.erlang.org/doc/man/erl.html
## -mode/-name/-sname/-setcookie are configured via env vars, do not set them here

## Optimize ERTS memory allocators for 512 MB cgroups v2 container:
## - MBas aobf: Address order best fit returns memory to kernel faster
## - MBacul 0: Carrier utilization limit 0% frees empty carriers immediately
-MBas aobf
-MHas aobf
-MPas aobf
-MDas aobf
-MFas aobf
-MBacul 0
-MHacul 0
-MBsmbcs 64
-MBlmbcs 128
